      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Various rank eight immortal materials must be merged to create this temporary multicolored whirlpool. The whirlpool gradually dissipates not long after, and it has no use besides deceiving wisdom Gu to change location.",
      "chapters": [
        1562
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "temporary-merge",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_wisdom_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When the refinement path immortal formation is removed, the aura of the multicolored whirlpool spreads, and distant wisdom Gu flies over and jumps into the whirlpool as if drunk. Fang Yuan cannot control wisdom Gu, but he can move the lump of multicolored whirlpool from afar. According to legends, wisdom Gu’s recipe contains a large amount of information path immortal materials, and in nature a wild wisdom Gu completes advancement only in areas full of information path dao marks.",
      "chapters": [
        1562
      ],
